&lt;li&gt;C, C++, and Python;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automotive sensors such as Cameras, LiDARs, or Radars;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embedded Systems; and&lt;/li&gt;
