t;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW77687772 BCX8&quot;&gt;alls and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW77687772 BCX8&quot;&gt;emails to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW77687772 BCX8&quot;&gt;create&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW77687772 BCX8&quot;&gt; opportunities. Your goal will be to exceed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW77687772 BCX8&quot;&gt; your &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW77687772 BCX8&quot;&gt;quota&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW77687772 BCX8&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW77687772 BCX8&quot;&gt; while intentionally preparing yourself for &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW77687772 BCX8&quot;&gt;future sales and leadership promotions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW77687772 BCX8&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How will you make an impact?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
